#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebuild the v6.7.11 script set from user-supplied Japanese Switch scripts.

This script restores a frozen, SHA-256-checked Pass 5 review checkpoint, runs the
published transformation pipeline, applies a compact correction patch for the
last manual edits, and verifies the packed archive against the canonical hash.
It does not include game archives or the final translated script files.

Usage: python build_v6_7_11.py INPUT_SCRIPT_ARC_OR_ZIP OUTPUT_SCRIPT_ARC
Prefer the original Japanese Switch script.arc: the builder extracts it and
automatically generates _index.txt in the original archive order. A ZIP bundle
is also accepted if it contains script_sw/*.txt and script_sw/_index.txt.
"""
